{"id":"642861","name":"排骨板栗焖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/642861/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"板栗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇提前泡发。","img":"images/642861/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨斩块后洗净。","img":"images/642861/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"排骨加入适量生抽，蚝油，玉米淀粉和花生油抓匀。","img":"images/642861/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"板栗用开水烫一下后去皮。","img":"images/642861/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜洗净切小丁。","img":"images/642861/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"香菇切细。","img":"images/642861/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大米淘洗干净。","img":"images/642861/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中热油放入排骨小火慢煎，煎至微微金黄。","img":"images/642861/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入香菇炒香。","img":"images/642861/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入胡萝卜和板栗。","img":"images/642861/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/642861/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入大米翻炒均匀。","img":"images/642861/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"少许盐，蚝油，生抽调味炒匀。","img":"images/642861/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"炒匀的米和配菜盛入电饭锅中。","img":"images/642861/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入适量水。","img":"images/642861/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"水量跟米持平即可。","img":"images/642861/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"电饭锅精煮饭模式至程序结束即可。","img":"images/642861/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"出锅后盛出即可。","img":"images/642861/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/642861/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/642861/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}